<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>第六步 · 推广：厂商数量连起两个极端</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="462" width="530" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="center" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>图 2 · 价格加成随厂商数量的变化（按公式计算）</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="596" topLeftY="100" width="316" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>推广到 n 家厂商，均衡变为</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="596" topLeftY="130" width="316" height="54"><content textType="body" fontSize="26" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[Q^{*}=\frac{n}{n+1}\cdot\frac{a-c}{b}]]></latex></formula></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="596" topLeftY="186" width="316" height="54"><content textType="body" fontSize="26" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p><formula><latex><![CDATA[p^{*}-c=\frac{a-c}{n+1}]]></latex></formula></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="596" topLeftY="254" width="316" height="84"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>n＝1 回到垄断，n＝2 是古诺，n 趋于无穷时价格趋近成本。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="596" topLeftY="340" width="316" height="112"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>“竞争程度”不再是定性标签，而是可以用厂商数量刻画、可以取极限的变量。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p><!-- citation: [7] --></p><p>把两家推广到 n 家，每家产量是 (a − c)/[(n+1)b]，价格高于成本的部分是 (a − c)/(n+1)。</p><p>这张图是按公式算出来的：厂商越多，加成越薄，但下降速度越来越慢。</p><p>这是古诺最重要的创造：垄断和完全竞争不再是两种互不相干的市场，而是同一条曲线上的两个点。</p></content></note></slide>